		"notes": "\n\t<p><i>Gangly undead woman, joints twisted and bent. Lanky hair obscures her face. Born from strong emotions.</i></p>\n\t<p></p>\n\t<p><strong>AC</strong> 14, <strong>HP</strong> 31, <strong>ATK</strong> 2 touch +4 (2d6) or death gaze, <strong>MV</strong> near, <strong>S</strong> +0, <strong>D</strong> +4, <strong>C</strong> +0, <strong>I</strong> +1, <strong>W</strong> +3, <strong>Ch</strong> +4, <strong>AL</strong> <strong>C</strong>, <strong>LV</strong> 7</p><p></p>\n\t<p><strong>Death Gaze</strong>. Part hair and show face to creature within close. WIS 15+ or terrified for 1d4 rounds. On a natural 1, dies of fright.</p><p></p><p><strong>Greater Undead</strong>. Immune to morale checks. Only damaged by silver or magical sources.</p><p></p>\n\t<p><i>Shadowfinder Complete Bestiary</i></p>",
